atch the Throne God’s Taikyoku and eventually kill them and True Death Cell will parish along their Originator as parish (e.g., Reinhardt acting as Mercurius's True Death Cell). However, if Throne God that True Death Cell is connected to no longer possesses subconscious wish to end their existence or wish to continue living, Throne God gains the ability to kill their True Death Cell permanently but however, if they were once again wish for death, that ceased True Death Cell is able to comeback to finish what they started.
